menu "Basecamp bootloader"

    config BASECAMP_USB_RESET_IS_COLD
        bool "Treat USB-Serial-JTAG chip resets as a cold boot (return to menu)"
        default y
        help
            esptool / idf.py monitor reset the chip through the USB-Serial-JTAG
            peripheral (reset reasons USB_UART / USB_JTAG). When enabled, such
            resets discard the stored slot selection and boot the launcher, which
            is what you want after flashing. Disable if an app relies on host-
            triggered resets staying inside the app.

endmenu
